# This app makes NO env-var-driven API calls at all — every request uses a
# relative path (e.g. /api/economy/overview), and routing is handled
# entirely by:
#   - vite.config.js's proxy config in development
#   - netlify.toml's redirects in production
# There is currently no Socket.IO usage in the admin client, so unlike the
# game client, there's no exception needed here — this file intentionally
# has nothing to configure right now.
